{"seq":1,"slug":"chinese","title":"一年级语文","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese","introMarkdown":"# 一年级语文 简介\n\n一年级语文是小学语文学习的开端，面向六至七岁刚刚步入小学的孩子。这个阶段的核心任务是让学生从口语世界顺利过渡到书面语世界，掌握拼音这把识字的钥匙，积累最基础的汉字储备，并在听说读写中逐步感受语言的魅力。\n\n本内容共包含三个章节。第一章**拼音识字**，系统讲解声母、韵母、整体认读音节的认读与书写，同步学习常用汉字的笔画笔顺，帮助学生建立音形义的初步关联。第二章**阅读理解**，从简短的儿歌、故事和生活场景文本入手，培养学生逐字逐句朗读的习惯，学习提取关键信息和理解简单因果关系。第三章**写作表达**，引导学生从看图说话开始，逐步过渡到写完整的句子，重点训练语句通顺、用词准确和基本标点的使用。\n\n一年级语文学习需要大量的朗读和抄写练习。建议每天坚持亲子共读十五分钟以上，鼓励孩子大声朗读课文，在读中认字、在读中理解。识字不必一次求全，重在反复接触和自然积累。写字练习要注意坐姿和握笔姿势，养成端正书写的好习惯。\n\n本内容适合一年级学生、家长以及小学低年级语文教师参考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pinyin-literacy","title":"拼音识字","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/pinyin-literacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"initials-and-finals","title":"一年级语文 — 声母与韵母","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/pinyin-literacy/initials-and-finals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tones-and-syllables","title":"一年级语文 — 声调与音节","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/pinyin-literacy/tones-and-syllables"},{"seq":3,"slug":"basic-characters","title":"一年级语文 — 基础汉字","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/pinyin-literacy/basic-characters"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"reading-comprehension","title":"阅读理解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/reading-comprehension","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"picture-book-reading","title":"一年级语文 — 绘本阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/reading-comprehension/picture-book-reading"},{"seq":2,"slug":"short-text-comprehension","title":"一年级语文 — 短文理解","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/reading-comprehension/short-text-comprehension"},{"seq":3,"slug":"poetry-appreciation","title":"一年级语文 — 古诗欣赏","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/reading-comprehension/poetry-appreciation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"writing-expression","title":"写作表达","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/writing-expression","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stroke-order-practice","title":"一年级语文 — 笔顺练习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/writing-expression/stroke-order-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"word-building","title":"一年级语文 — 组词造句","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/writing-expression/word-building"},{"seq":3,"slug":"simple-sentences","title":"一年级语文 — 简单句子","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-1/chinese/writing-expression/simple-sentences"}]}]}